{
  "info": {
    "name": "CAB CRM PHP API",
    "description": "Verified routes from this repository. Set baseUrl to the backend root plus /api. PHP session cookies are managed by Postman cookie jar; login saves csrfToken for mutating calls. Replace all example IDs and credentials with records/accounts available in your environment. See MOBILE_API_DOCUMENTATION.md for validation, permissions, and response schemas.",
